    "Rhythm is a metronome, not repetition detection. It never changes your actual count. Pulses can interrupt Watch heart-rate sampling. There is no app-controlled vibration intensity.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rhythm is an optional metronome, not repetition detection. It never changes your recorded count. With an active workout session it can continue when your wrist is down. It stops if that session pauses or ends. Haptic timing and feel depend on watchOS."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El ritmo es un metrónomo opcional, no un detector de repeticiones. No cambia tu registro. Con una sesión de entrenamiento activa puede continuar al bajar la muñeca. Se detiene si la sesión se pausa o termina. El tiempo y la sensación del pulso dependen de watchOS."
          }
        }
      }
    },
