          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1. Añade Prepare Workout Review de Little Lift. Su texto incluye el contexto autorizado y el registro que vas a revisar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2. Add Use Model, choose the ChatGPT extension model, and use the previous action’s output as its prompt. Set Output to Text so the JSON passes to the next action. Enable Follow Up if you want to review or refine the answer there.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2. Add Use Model, choose the ChatGPT extension model, and use the previous action’s output as its prompt. Set Output to Text so the JSON passes to the next action. Enable Follow Up if you want to review or refine the answer there."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2. Añade Usar modelo, elige la extensión de ChatGPT y usa el resultado anterior como instrucciones. Elige salida Texto para pasar el JSON a la siguiente acción. Activa Seguimiento si quieres revisar o ajustar la respuesta allí."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3. Add Little Lift’s Save Workout Review action. Pass the model response into Review JSON.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3. Add Little Lift’s Save Workout Review action. Pass the model response into Review JSON."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3. Añade Save Workout Review de Little Lift. Pasa la respuesta a Review JSON."
          }
        }
      }
    },
