    "Use Model may still require authentication, confirmation or an unlocked phone. If unattended execution is unavailable, use Run review Shortcut. Model failures stay visible in Coach reviews; cancel or retry there. Duplicate triggers are blocked by the durable review receipt.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use Model may still require authentication, confirmation or an unlocked phone. If unattended execution is unavailable, use Run review Shortcut. Model failures stay visible in Coach reviews; cancel or retry there. Duplicate triggers are blocked by the durable review receipt."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usar modelo puede requerir autenticación, confirmación o el teléfono desbloqueado. Si no permite ejecución desatendida, usa Abrir atajo de revisión. Los errores quedan en Revisiones del coach; cancela o reintenta allí. Los identificadores persistentes evitan duplicados."
          }
        }
      }
    },
