    "[{0}] {1} · Set ID: {2}\n{3}": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "[{0}] {1} · Set ID: {2}\n{3}"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "[{0}] {1} · ID de serie: {2}\n{3}"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\nPlease log these actual results and give descriptive feedback. Do not treat uncompleted sets as completed. Compare across workouts only when variation IDs, units and load conventions match; otherwise explain insufficient data. Log-tap intervals include exercise time and do not measure actual rest. Strength sets have no physical start/end or motion measurements. Timed activities report explicit Start/Pause/Resume/Done events, not sensor measurements. Do not infer causation, injury risk or medical readiness. Propose any next plan for my review; never assume it has been accepted.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\nPlease log these actual results and give descriptive feedback. Do not treat uncompleted sets as completed. Compare across workouts only when variation IDs, units and load conventions match; otherwise explain insufficient data. Log-tap intervals include exercise time and do not measure actual rest. Strength sets have no physical start/end or motion measurements. Timed activities report explicit Start/Pause/Resume/Done events, not sensor measurements. Do not infer causation, injury risk or medical readiness. Propose any next plan for my review; never assume it has been accepted."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\nRegistra estos resultados reales y da comentarios descriptivos. No trates lo pendiente como realizado. Compara solo variantes, unidades y convenciones de carga coincidentes; si faltan datos, dilo. El intervalo entre registros incluye ejercicio y no mide descanso real. Las series de fuerza no tienen medidas físicas de inicio, fin ni movimiento. Las actividades cronometradas reflejan toques de Iniciar/Pausa/Reanudar/Listo, no sensores. No infieras causalidad, riesgo de lesión ni aptitud médica. Propón otro plan para que lo revise; nunca supongas que fue aceptado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
