    "Strength timing is the interval between Log taps, including exercise time. Actual rest and repetition timing are unavailable. Timed activities use your Start, Pause, Resume and Done events.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Strength timing is the interval between Log taps, including exercise time. Actual rest and repetition timing are unavailable. Timed activities use your Start, Pause, Resume and Done events."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En fuerza, el intervalo entre registros incluye la ejecución. No se conoce el descanso real ni el tiempo por repetición. Las actividades cronometradas usan tus eventos de iniciar, pausar, reanudar y terminar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
